\f0\fs24 \cf0 # \uc0\u9992 \u65039  United Airlines SkyHack 3.0 Project\
\
### \uc0\u55357 \u56522  Objective\
Developed a data-driven solution to optimize United Airlines\'92 flight operations and customer experience during the SkyHack 3.0 hackathon.\
\
### \uc0\u55358 \u56800  Problem Statement\
Analyzed large-scale operational and customer datasets to uncover insights for improving route efficiency, minimizing delays, and enhancing passenger satisfaction.\
\
### \uc0\u9881 \u65039  Tools & Technologies\
- Python (Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib)\
- SQL\
- Power BI / Tableau\
- Excel\
\
### \uc0\u55357 \u56520  Key Insights\
- Identified factors affecting flight delays such as weather and airport congestion.\
- Built interactive dashboards for visualizing route profitability and delay trends.\
- Recommended strategies for improving on-time performance by ~12%.\
